# Legal / trademark filing correspondence. These carry the applicant's name,
# address and contact details, so they must not ride along into a repo that is
# headed for public. Keep the files on disk, keep them out of the history — the
# secret scan in CI does not look for PII, and history is forever once pushed.
*Filing-Record*
docs/*.docx
